# API Integration

## Two axios instances

```ts
// laravelApi — baseURL: import.meta.env.VITE_LARAVEL_API_URL
// nodeApi    — baseURL: import.meta.env.VITE_NODE_API_URL
// Both: Authorization: Bearer <token>, Accept: application/json
```

## Laravel endpoints (primary)

| Area | Methods |
|------|---------|
| Auth | `POST /auth/login`, `POST /auth/register`, `GET /auth/me`, `POST /auth/logout` |
| Users | `GET/POST /users`, `GET/PATCH /users/:id`, `PATCH /users/:id/status` |
| Teams | `GET/POST /teams`, `GET /teams/:id`, `POST/DELETE /teams/:id/members/:userId` |
| Tasks | `GET/POST /teams/:teamId/tasks`, `GET/PATCH/DELETE /tasks/:id`, `PATCH /tasks/:id/status` |

## Node endpoints (admin/manager only)

| Method | Path |
|--------|------|
| GET | `/analytics/task-summary?team_id=&date_from=&date_to=` |
| GET | `/analytics/team-productivity?team_id=` |
| GET | `/analytics/upcoming-deadlines?team_id=` |
| POST | `/export/tasks` — body: `{ team_id, format, filters }` |

## Error handling

- 401 → clear auth, redirect login
- 403 → toast: permission denied
- 422 → show `errors` from response
- Loading states on all async actions; use toast for success/error
